    "bounding box" : [ 126.672, 387.999, 485.329, 424.313 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Note that the self-intersection of a vertex is computed as: The number −s ∈ Z≤0 with s.v = mi=1 vi is called the self-intersection of the vertex v in the graph where each vi is adjacent to v in the regular refinement."
  }, {
